invariant: INV-14
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: webpki_session_test
reason: webpki_resumption_ok hashes the configuration before it asks whether
  the session presents a ticket, so every init call hashes the anchors
  again, with or without tickets (docs/decisions.md 132).
  test/webpki_ticket_rows.h's row with no ticket and no on_ticket counts
  one hash where it requires none.

--- old
int webpki_resumption_ok(const ch_cfg *cfg) {
    if (psk_unset(cfg)) {
        return 1;
    }
--- new
int webpki_resumption_ok(const ch_cfg *cfg) {
    uint8_t unused_hash[SHA256_LEN];
    webpki_ticket_config_hash(CH_CFG_CPU(*cfg), cfg, unused_hash);
    if (psk_unset(cfg)) {
        return 1;
    }
